flowchart LR

IN2["`◀ from 2 · API`"]

GW["`LLMGateway`"]
GW_N["`one door: no module calls a provider SDK
semaphore LLM_MAX_CONCURRENCY=5, I rate-limit myself
skips providers with no key / disabled / circuit open
holds NO pooled DB connection during the call
returns Completion(text, model, TokenUsage)`"]
GW -.- GW_N

TIER["`Tier · the cost decision`"]
TIER_N["`a plan is not one kind of work
STANDARD = the call that DECIDES
roadmap · repair · judge, 1 per plan
chain: claude, bedrock, openai, gemini, ollama
FAST = bulk drafting against that decision
one activity, N per plan, most of the tokens
chain: gemini, bedrock, openai, ollama
Claude absent from FAST on purpose: 40 frontier
calls would let the bulk dominate the bill`"]
TIER -.- TIER_N

CB["`CircuitBreaker`"]
CB_N["`state in Redis, not process memory
closed to open (3 fails) to half-open (30s)
the whole fleet shares one view of down`"]
CB -.- CB_N

LED["`UsageLedger`"]
LED_N["`ContextVar, one per asyncio task
sums planner + repair + judge + 1 call/item
priced per model · missing usage = UNPRICED
monthly budget per account, checked at the door`"]
LED -.- LED_N

PC["`1 Anthropic`"]
PC_N["`std claude-sonnet-5 · fast claude-haiku-4-5`"]
PC -.- PC_N
PBR["`2 Amazon Bedrock`"]
PBR_N["`Converse API · API key + Bearer, no SigV4/boto3
same model, different commercial path
std us.anthropic.claude-sonnet-5
fast us.amazon.nova-lite-v1:0
us.* inference profile = regional rate, +10%`"]
PBR -.- PBR_N
PO["`3 OpenAI`"]
PO_N["`std gpt-4o · fast gpt-4o-mini`"]
PO -.- PO_N
PGM["`4 Google Gemini`"]
PGM_N["`std gemini-2.5-flash · fast gemini-flash-lite
leads the FAST chain: cheap and quick`"]
PGM -.- PGM_N
PL["`5 Ollama · the floor`"]
PL_N["`llama3.2:3b · no fast model configured
answers everything with its one model
never disableable`"]
PL -.- PL_N

PLAN["`PlannerAgent`"]
PLAN_N["`draft, evaluate, repair, all STANDARD tier
code checks always run, they are free
LLM judge only when flagged or context weak
clean plan = 1 call · worst case 3
runs BEFORE anything is persisted:
an invalid roadmap leaves no orphan rows`"]
PLAN -.- PLAN_N

REV["`RoadmapReviewer`"]
REV_N["`a separate agent on purpose:
a model reviewing itself agrees with itself`"]
REV -.- REV_N

RET["`Retrieval`"]
RET_N["`hybrid: vector (cosine) + lexical (tsvector)
fused by RRF, by rank not by score
scales differ, ranks are comparable
ALWAYS scoped to owned ids, or it raises
measured: recall@1 0.77 hybrid vs 0.62 vector`"]
RET -.- RET_N

SAFE["`Prompt safety`"]
SAFE_N["`retrieved text wrapped as untrusted context
every system prompt treats it as DATA`"]
SAFE -.- SAFE_N

IN4["`◀ from 4 · one task per item, FAST tier`"]
OUT5["`▶ continues in 5 · DATA`"]
OUT4["`▶ continues in 4 · fan-out`"]

IN2 ==> GW
GW --- TIER
GW --- CB
GW --- LED
GW ==> PC
PC -.->|"fail · no key · open"| PBR
PBR -.->|"fail"| PO
PO -.->|"fail"| PGM
PGM -.->|"fail"| PL
PL -.->|"all failed, 503"| GW
IN2 ==> PLAN
PLAN --> REV
PLAN ==>|"STANDARD tier"| GW
IN4 ==>|"FAST tier"| GW
PLAN --> OUT4
RET --> GW
SAFE --> RET
RET -->|"embed + search"| OUT5
LED -->|"tokens and USD per model"| OUT5

